    "f-heading-1721383310Yt0zo-text_html": "COLOR + TYPEFACE",
    "f-richtext-1721383310AbOR4-text_html": "Typographic hierarchy system based on human interface guideliness. Aesthetic from while keeping text legibility, prioritize content and emphasize important information.",
    "f-button-1721383310rB01C-button_label_html": "brown",
    "f-button-17213833104VSOm-button_label_html": "signifier",
    "f-heading-1721383310mPhXV-text_html": "typography",
    "f-richtext-1721383310qKr60-text_html": "Typographic hierarchy system based on human interface guideliness. Aesthetic from while keeping text legibility, prioritize content and emphasize important information. We maintain a default of 150% line weight in all our typography usage.",
    "f-richtext-1721383310rWDYT-text_html": "At The Future Rocks, we’re not selling sustainability, we’re implementing it. We’re setting the stage for a new generation of creative and conscious, future-forward jewelry designers with innovative practices.",
    "f-richtext-1721383310pfFF4-text_html": "At The Future Rocks, we’re not selling sustainability, we’re implementing it. We’re setting the stage for a new generation of creative and conscious, future-forward jewelry designers with innovative practices.",
    "f-richtext-1721383310Zhy46-text_html": "ザ・フューチャーロックスは、持続可能性を販売するのではなく、それを実践しています。私たちは、革新的なプラクティスに基づいて、創造的で意識的である、未来志向な次世代のジュエリーデザイナーのための舞台を用意しています。",
    "f-richtext-17213833102MmoB-text_html": "ザ・フューチャーロックスは、持続可能性を販売するのではなく、それを実践しています。私たちは、革新的なプラクティスに基づいて、創造的で意識的である、未来志向な次世代のジュエリーデザイナーのための舞台を用意しています。",
    "f-richtext-1721383310pQgpZ-text_html": "The Future Rocks 는 지속 가능성을 판매하는 것이 아니라 이를 구현하고 있습니다. 우리는 혁신적인 관행을 바탕으로 창의적이고 의식적이며 미래 지향적인 차세대 주얼리 디자이너를 위한 무대를 마련하고 있습니다.",
    "f-richtext-1721383310qCxyw-text_html": "The Future Rocks 는 지속 가능성을 판매하는 것이 아니라 이를 구현하고 있습니다. 우리는 혁신적인 관행을 바탕으로 창의적이고 의식적이며 미래 지향적인 차세대 주얼리 디자이너를 위한 무대를 마련하고 있습니다.",
    "f-heading-1721383310DQRXR-text_html": "brown pro",
    "f-richtext-17213833105yxHd-text_html": "<a href=\"https://lineto.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">lineto</a>",
    "f-richtext-1721383310X6xBR-text_html": "LL Brown is designed by Aurèle Sack, first released by Lineto in 2011. The Additional scripts were produced in collaboration with Ilya Ruderman (Cyrillic), Panos Haratzopoulos (Greek), Titus Nemeth (Arabic), and Daniel Grumer (Hebrew). Additional styles such as LL Brown Condensed, LL Brown Narrow, LL Brown Mono, LL Brown Inline and LL Brown Graphic were released in 2020. Font engineering and mastering by Alphabet Type GmbH.",
    "f-richtext-1721383310Euuzn-text_html": "01",
    "f-richtext-1721383310w01KV-text_html": "Tt",
